The host uses the pinned Kimmo3223/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup Skate engine.
The exporter uses the pinned SK8-ENGINE/skate-3-rust-engine tools.
Their license notices remain in their vendor checkouts.
MelonLoader and its bundled dependencies retain their own notices.
No game assets or generated game assemblies are included in source control.

patches/skate-core-floor-seams.patch modifies the pinned engine's board-world,
sphere/primitive contact queries, off-board support motion and its regression
tests. Applied files carry notices identifying the Skate Schedule changes.
patches/skate-host-carry-hand.patch exposes the native possession controller's
selected hand for carried-board avatar retargeting; the modified file identifies
this change. It does not change the native possession or physics logic.

